572ad63213d0c620b0718e0.webm?t=1726583406\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1520240/extras/e95168f00572ad63213d0c620b0718e0.mp4?t=1726583406\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The controller setting is easy.</h2>We have prepared a controller setting screen similar to that like a Nintendo Switch.<br><br>Even if the number of players changes, you can quickly finish the settings.<br><br>Supported Controllers<br>SwitchPro Controller Bluetooth connection will be more stable than wired connection.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Various keyboards<br></li><li>Various gamepads<br></li><li>PS4 controller (not tested)<br></li><li>XBOX controller (not tested)<br></li><li>SwitchPro Controller</li></ul></h2>",
    "short_description": "They scatter, they throw, they smash each other! A game cleaning robots! &quot;Scatter Battlers&quot; is a shooting battle game in which cleaning robots pick up trash and non-trash objects and throw them at each other. Also, there's a co-op mode. Difficulty VS Boss \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2606\u2606 VS100 Robots \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605",
